{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Wild Frontier of Feathers and Dust.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this open-world farming simulation, you will venture into a tough, sunbaked land where wild chickens roam freely. Capture and tame them to create your own chicken farm, and transform your simple coop into a successful ranch. Meet the locals, take on various jobs, and navigate  dunes. Ensure your chickens are fed, content, and protected, or see your egg empire crumble under the blazing sun. Whether you are pursuing rare breeds across the desert, selling fresh eggs in the market, or enhancing your farm, each day presents new challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch and Tame Chickens\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Farm</strong><br><strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell Produce</strong><br><strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Open World\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do Quests for Locals\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend Your Chickens\u00a0and Keep Them Happy</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102600?t=1762242539","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102600/fa3e1a23b98ca1fecfeb392eff328b4f0fde7c3e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762242539","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102600/46389eeceb4028a63ae391400f3b0af87bd69e1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762242539","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102600/46389eeceb4028a63ae391400f3b0af87bd69e1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762242539","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller s